================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

Server (Go):
  - github.com/gorilla/websocket              (BSD-2-Clause)
  - modernc.org/sqlite                        (BSD-3-Clause)
  - github.com/oschwald/geoip2-golang         (ISC)
  - github.com/oschwald/maxminddb-golang      (ISC; via geoip2-golang)
  - github.com/coreos/go-oidc/v3              (Apache-2.0)
  - golang.org/x/oauth2                       (BSD-3-Clause)

Agent (Go):
  - github.com/gorilla/websocket              (BSD-2-Clause)
  - github.com/redis/go-redis/v9              (BSD-2-Clause)

GeoIP data (optional feature):
  This product can use GeoLite2 data created by MaxMind, available from
  https://www.maxmind.com. The GeoLite2 database is NOT distributed with this
  project; operators must supply their own under MaxMind's GeoLite2 EULA, which
  requires attribution.

UI (npm):
  - react, react-dom                    (MIT)
  - radix-ui                            (MIT)
  - lucide-react                        (ISC)
  - d3-geo                              (ISC)
  - topojson-client                     (ISC)
  - tailwindcss, @tailwindcss/vite, tailwind-merge, clsx,
    class-variance-authority, tw-animate-css (MIT)
  - yaml                                (ISC)

World map boundaries rendered by the UI use TopoJSON data derived from Natural
Earth (public domain) via the world-atlas project (loaded at runtime from CDN;
not vendored in this repo).

Exact versions are pinned in server/go.mod, agent/go.mod, and ui/package.json.
This list covers direct runtime dependencies on a best-effort basis; consult
each dependency's own license (and its transitive tree) for authoritative terms.
